# Engineering Implementation Plan: mcp-query-server

## Project Overview

Build a **PostgreSQL MCP Tool Server** using **FastMCP** in Python 3.11+.

This service sits in an AI Agent architecture as a pure database-access layer:

```
API Gateway
  ↓
Agent Core (LLM + Skills)
  ↓
MCP Query Server  ← THIS SERVICE
  ↓
PostgreSQL
```

> **Constraint**: The server MUST NOT contain any LLM or business logic. It only exposes safe, read-only database tools.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Runtime | Python 3.11+ |
| MCP Framework | FastMCP |
| DB Driver | asyncpg (preferred) or psycopg3 |
| Config | Environment variables (.env) |
| Container | Docker + docker-compose |

---

